<title>UK: Scholl sells herbal remedies business.</title>
<headline>Scholl sells herbal remedies business.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK footwear and healthcare group Scholl Plc said it has sold herbal remedies business, Gerard House to Peter Black Holdings Plc for 2.5 million stg, subject to adjustment for stock valuation.</p>
<p>The disposal forms part of the group's strategy, outlined in its interim statement in September, to focus on the Scholl brand and footcare and footwear.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
